    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTranquillity, countryside, space and potential are words synonymous with this property.\nLocated equidistant between Golden and Donaskeigh villages this is a hugely attractive cottage offering wistful/nostalgic vibes evoking a cozy longing for simpler times.\nInternally the house is a cosy inviting space with deep set windows and dappled light throughout.\nThe property benefit from a natural divide with a split driveway, one to the main cottage and the other to a detached garage/outbuilding which would make a pefect residential unit (subject to pp) offering a granny flat or additional income. Alternatively it would be perfect as a workshop/gym or work from home space. \nThis is a property with much potential or simply perfect the way it is."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.78m x 1.75m\nTiled floor\n\nKitchen - 3.05m x 4.57m\nBuilt in units. Tiled floor. Cut stone feature wall. Door to parking area.\n\nLiving Room - 5.05m x 3.58m\nTiled floor. Solid fuel stove with cut stone surround.\n\nBathroom - 2.08m x 1.65m\nShower unit, sink and w.c.. Tiled floor.\n\nBedroom One - 3.05m x 3.35m\nGround floor. Carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom Two - 4.57m x 3.05m\nFirst Floor, Carpet flooring\n\nBedroom Three - 3.91m x 4.88m\nFirst Floor. Carpet Flooring\n\n"
      },
